.TH GIT-RECENT-COMMITTERS 1 "2026-04-01"
.SH NAME
git-recent-committers \- list committers from the last N days
.SH SYNOPSIS
git recent-committers [-n DAYS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists authors who have made commits in the last N days with their commit counts.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
-n DAYS
Number of days to look back.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
GIT_RECENT_COMMITTERS_DAYS
Default number of day=7.
.SH EXAMPLES
git recent-committers
git recent-committers -n 10
